  "content": "[Intro]\n[C]\n[G]  [Am]  [G/B]\n[Dm]  [F]\n[Gsus2]  [G]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[C]Weak and [Dm]wounded [C/E]sinner\n[G]Lost and left [Am]to die [G/B]O,\n[Dm]raise your head, for love [F]is passing by\n[Gsus2][G]Come to Jesus\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]Come to Jesus\n[F]Come to Jesus\n[C][G]and\n[C]live!\n\n[Verse 2]\n[C]Now your [Dm]burden's [C/E]lifted And\n[G]carried far [Am]away [G/B]And\n[Dm]precious blood has washed [F]away the stain,\n[Gsus2][G]so Sing to Jesus\n\n[Chords]\n[C]Sing to\n[F]Jesus Sing to Je-\n[C][G]sus and\n[C]live!\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Db]And like a [Ebm]newborn [Db]baby Don't\n[Ab]be afraid [Bbm]to crawl [Ab]And re-\n[Ebm]member when you walk Sometimes we fall,\n[Ab]so Fall on Jesus\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]Fall on\n[Gb]Jesus Fall on\n[Db]Jesus [Ab]and\n[Db]live!\n[Gb]\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Db]Sometimes the [Ebm]way is [Db]lonely And\n[Ab]steep and filled [Bbm]with pain [Ab]So\n[Ebm]if your sky is dark [Gb]and pours the rain,\n[Ab]then Cry to Jesus\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]Cry\n[Gb]to Jesus Cry to Jesus\n[Db]and\n[Gb]live!\n[Ab][Bbm]O, and\n\n[Verse 5]\n[Eb]when the love [Fm]spills [Eb]over And\n[Bb]music fills [Cm]the [Bb]night And\n[Fm]when you can't contain [Ab]your joy inside,\n[Bb]then Dance for Jesus\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]Dance for\n[Ab]Jesus Dance for Je-\n[Eb][Bb]sus\n[Eb]and live! [Ab]\n[Eb][Bb]And\n\n[Verse 6]\n[Eb]with your [Fm]final [Eb]heartbeat\n[Bb]Kiss the world [Cm]goodbye [Bb]Then\n[Fm]go in peace, and [Ab]laugh on Glory's\n[Bb]side, and Fly to\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]Jesus Fly to\n[Ab]Jesus Fly to Je-\n[Eb]sus [Bb]\n[Eb]and live! [Ab]\n[Eb][Bb]Fly to Jesus\n[Eb]Fly to\n[Ab]Jesus Fly to Je-\n[Eb]sus [Bb]and\n[Eb]live!",
